{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"3JN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約翰三書","commonName":"約翰三書","title":"約翰三書","order":64,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"5b1c5c77b2c86756d9abf6022c647a0093c81c6fb7d3691107ff17082e5268a0","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/3JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/3JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":15},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我這作長老的寫信給親愛的該猶，你是我本著真理所愛的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["親愛的弟兄，我願你凡事順利，身體像靈魂一樣健康。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["該猶的好品行"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["一些弟兄來為你作見證，說你忠心地遵行真理，這使我非常歡喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["沒有比聽見自己的孩子遵行真理更使我歡喜了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["親愛的弟兄，你常常忠心地照顧素不相識的弟兄，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他們把你的愛心告訴了教會。願你照著上帝喜悅的方式繼續幫助他們出行，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因為他們為了主的名四處傳道，不接受非信徒的任何幫助。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我們理當接待這樣的人，好成為他們傳揚真理的同工。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["丟特腓的惡行"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我曾寫信給你那裡的教會，但愛當頭領的丟特腓不接待我們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因此，我若去你們那裡，必揭露他的所作所為，他怎樣惡言中傷我們。不僅如此，他還拒絕接待弟兄，並且禁止別人接待，甚至將接待的人趕出教會。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["抑惡揚善"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["親愛的弟兄，不要效法罪惡，要效法美善。行善的人屬於上帝，行惡的人不認識上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["低米丟得到了眾人的好評，真理也為他作見證，我們也為他作見證。你知道我們的見證是真實的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["結語"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我還有許多事要告訴你，但不想藉助筆墨，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["只希望很快見到你，跟你當面暢談。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["願你平安！這裡的朋友們都問候你，請代我一一問候你那邊的朋友。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/3JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JUD/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2JN/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}